# Alfonso session artifacts (drafts, task outputs, context) — never repo content.
# A fired spec draft writes into .cortexkit/alfonso/drafts/; without this ignore,
# that file dirties the parent repo and blocks every mason worktree dispatch.
.cortexkit/alfonso/*
!.cortexkit/alfonso/rules/

# Internal design material stays out of the repository by policy.
docs/design/
docs/field-notes.md
# Rust build artifacts.
target/